  "brain_first": "“找整段一直围绕的事情，不追最具体的一个细节。”",
  "sort_order": 1010,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 449
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "What are the speakers mainly talking about? /",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 450
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "What is the talk mainly about?",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 451
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 452
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "主旨题要找覆盖整段的“上位概念”。",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 453
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “找整段一直围绕的事情，不追最具体的一个细节。”",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 454
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 错误选项经常来自某个具体细节，因为你刚听到它，印象最深。",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 455
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 456
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 开头听主题入口，中间听反复出现的核心名词，结尾听决定/总结。",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 457
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 把每个选项问自己：能不能罩住大部分内容？",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 458
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 如果选项只对应一句细节，先降级。",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 459
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 优先选“人物为什么在谈这些细节”的总主题。",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 460
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 题号旁只记最短符号：关键词 / old→new / + / - / ?。数字写成“30→25”，计",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 461
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "划写成“drive→sleep”；不要抄完整句。",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 462
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 463
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 多个细节都围绕一次 trip → 主旨是 trip planning，不是某家酒店",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 464
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 独白列多个 tips → 主旨通常是 how to...",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 465
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 一个选项能解释至少两到三个主要信息点。",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 466
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 若两个选项都大，选更贴合材料“目的”的那个，而不是无限泛化。",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 467
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 468
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "对话先谈火车票，再谈住宿，再谈景点安排。主旨应是 planning a trip，而不是 buying train tickets。",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 469
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 470
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 选最后一句细节。",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 471
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 选范围过大的“life / technology / education”泛主题。",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 472
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 473
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 能覆盖整段吗？",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 474
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 是不是只覆盖一个细节？",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 475
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： L-K 关键词漏听｜L-C 改口没更新｜L-P 同",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 476
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "义替换没认出｜L-I 推断过远｜L-A 态度对象/强度错。",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 477
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 478
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 主旨找“所有细节为什么放在一起”。",
      "sourcePage": 17,
      "sourceIndex": 479
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 481
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 对话谈车票、酒店、景点，主旨？",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 482
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 独白连续给三条省钱建议，主旨？",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 483
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 主旨选项只对应最后一句，通常？",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 484
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. “technology”出现多次就一定是主旨吗？",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 485
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 主旨判断至少应覆盖几处主要信息？",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 486
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. planning a trip；2. how to save money / money-saving tips；3. 太窄。；4. 不一定，要看全段为何",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 487
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "谈这些细节。；5. 大部分/至少2-3个主要信息点。",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 488
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— L7 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“L7”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 489
    }
  ],
